WEBVTT

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.430
What's wrong, Asahi?

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:10.150
Oh, just thinking, it's really summer now.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.530
<i>It was still spring when
I found out Shiragami's secret.</i>

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:20.440
Thinking about how you still haven't 
confessed to Shiragami-san,

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.960
and now it's summer?

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.710
I have no answer to that...

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:28.600
It's summer, so why not try 
inviting her to the pool?

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.250
That should be easier than confessing to her.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.590
The pool, huh...

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.600
Hey, Asahi, I think you're gonna be fine.

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:41.720
You've gotten really close 
to Shiragami-san since then.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.780
Oh... R-Really?

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:47.690
Shiho and Aizawa-san. What's up?

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.690
Isn't that Shiragami-san?

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:52.230
Perfect timing. 
Asahi, invite her to the pool.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:52.610
Huh?

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.990
You can do this now.

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:55.910
Go!

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.070
O-Okay!

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.240
<i>That's right.</i>

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:04.710
<i>I'm not the same guy who tried to confess</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:06.370
Shiragami Youko-sama

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.330
<i>to her that day and couldn't.</i>

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.040
Sh-Shiragami!

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.760
What is it, Kuromine-kun?

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:16.170
<i>Right now...</i>

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:18.550
<i>I can ask her on a date!</i>

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:53.020
<b>Let's Put On
Our Swimsuits!</b>

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.090
Let's Put On Our Swimsuits!

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.320
P-Pool?

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.940
Ah, well... I mean...

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.990
If you don't want to, that's cool...

00:02:58.990 --> 00:02:59.760
Huh?!

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.020
Well, party's over...

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:01.820
Oka?!

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.580
No, um... Kuromine-kun...

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.750
It's not that I don't want to...

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:11.580
The thing is, Kuromine-kun, Youko can't swim.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.350
Hey! Shiho!

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:14.960
Really?

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.800
Saying you'd turn to ash in the sun,

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.800
I just tan easily!!

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:21.300
or that you couldn't go into flowing water...

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.300
It just makes me shiver!!

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:24.500
Who always made excuses like that 
to get out of swimming?

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.790
I feel bad for lying, but...

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.060
I-It's okay, Shiragami!

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.280
To be honest, I can't swim that well, either.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:34.820
Oh, really?

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:37.080
Then why'd you suggest the pool?

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.610
Oh! I get it!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:43.390
You wanted to go there to practice swimming?

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:45.360
Uh... Yeah.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.240
Exactly.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.930
<i>Talk about dense.</i>

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:50.440
<i>What a loser.</i>

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.970
Hmm, in that case, it might 
be a good opportunity.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:57.210
Okay! I'll go with you 
to the pool to practice!

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.080
Y-You really will?

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:00.100
Sure!

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:01.090
Oh, yeah.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:05.810
Aizawa-san, if you're free, 
would you teach me how to swim?

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:08.790
And you'll come too, right, Shiho?

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:12.060
It's okay if they come, right, Kuromine-kun?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:13.000
Huh?

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:16.150
Oh... Sure, that's fine.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:18.010
<i>Talk about dense.</i>

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:19.610
<i>What a loser.</i>

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:23.850
<i>W-Well, I guess going alone 
with her won't work out...</i>

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:25.030
<i>But still...</i>

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:29.520
<i>She seems happy about this, 
so I guess it's okay.</i>

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.870
<b>Pool Entrance</b>

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:39.500
And... why are you guys here, too?

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:42.080
Shishido-san told us all about it.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:44.690
You think we're gonna let 
you have all the fun?

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.300
Don't worry. We won't butt in.

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.290
You should be thankful.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:53.740
You're at the pool with Shiragami-san 
because I gave you a push.

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:57.310
Yeah, then you took off when 
things were looking grim.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:00.420
Hey, guys.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:03.690
Sorry for the wait.

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.000
Thank you very much!

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.200
Hey! That sounds like sexual harassment!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.060
Sorry about that.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.660
Um, Kuromine-kun...

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:18.040
It's kind of reassuring to have 
someone else here who can't swim.

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:21.420
Let's work hard to learn 
how to swim today, okay?

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:26.630
Y-Yeah. Let's do our best, Shiragami.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:28.810
Yeah! Thanks!

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:32.510
Well, if we can get started right away...

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:37.810
Time for Shishido Shiho's 
Square One Swimming Course!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:40.270
Her aide will be yours truly, Aizawa Nagisa.

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:43.210
You're not the leader this time, Class Rep?

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:45.400
It seems she has a brilliant plan.

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:48.030
I propose we see just what she's got.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:52.410
There's one trick to it: 
finding the cutest girl around.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:53.330
Huh?

00:05:53.690 --> 00:05:54.450
Pardon?

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.280
Okay.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:56.080
I see...

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.850
First, once she starts to swim...

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:04.730
Take aim and...

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:05.630
Lock on!

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.300
And then go after her butt!

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:11.600
Your heart will lead you from there.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.060
Hey!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.060
Shishido Shiho!

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.220
She's not just a pervert.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:16.890
She's a dirty old man.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.310
Okay! I'm gonna...

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:21.050
lock on!

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.650
I can't believe some people!

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:29.320
Okay, everyone, pay attention.

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:32.320
Aizawa-san is going to assist me this time.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.530
First, do this...

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:37.540
Take off your swimsuit!

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.960
Then swim your hardest so 
no one can see your nakedness...

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:47.090
Instructor Shishido Shiho has stepped down 
from her post due to an unforeseen accident.

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:50.840
I, Aizawa Nagisa, have stepped up to her post.

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:53.800
Thank you, Instructor!

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:56.560
This feels a lot safer after Shiho-san.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:59.040
Now, trainee Shiragami.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:02.280
As you cannot swim, you will 
need to get used to the water.

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:03.500
Yes, Instructor!

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:04.940
You're starting there?

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:08.190
All right, try entering the water feet-first.

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:08.940
Right!

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.950
What's the problem, trainee Shiragami?

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:17.290
I just... don't handle flowing water well...

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:17.920
Since I'm a vam—

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:18.790
Whoops!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.840
Oh, dear! My hand slipped!

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:22.500
What?!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.760
Our instructor's gone spartan already!

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:27.500
Fool!

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:30.040
What if those two had found out her secret?

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.330
Shiragami-san, are you okay?

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:31.260
O-Oh, yeah...

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:32.550
You're shivering hard.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.070
<i>That's not good.</i>

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:37.480
<i>I've gotten used to the fact 
that Shiragami's a vampire.</i>

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.120
A-Are you okay, Shiragami?

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:42.400
Won't your sunscreen come off in the water?

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:44.280
You'll burn to a crisp!

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:45.440
No problem.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:50.280
I put on a ton of waterproof sunscreen.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:53.040
I-I think you put on too much...

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:53.880
Ahem.

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:57.950
Next, we'll start with a fundamental 
part of swimming: floating.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.200
Yes, Instructor!

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:06.000
Good. Now hold that form.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.270
You're good at swimming, Class Rep?

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:11.720
Yes. I trained in swimming on my home planet.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.720
She's drifting away like a peach!

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.860
Trainee Shiragami!

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:25.630
O-Okay, next, you two will move 
to the pool and practice kicking.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:27.310
Yes, Instructor!

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:33.760
Kuromine Asahi, you're 
bending your body too much.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:38.990
C-Class Rep! Just telling 
me would've been enough!

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:42.960
Wh-Why, you! You weren't thinking 
dirty thoughts, were you?!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.000
Huh? Uh, no...

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.450
You two are getting along well.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:51.260
How many times must I tell 
you it's not like that?!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.760
This is merely part of his training!

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:54.760
Uh, Aizawa-san...

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:57.480
Kuromine-kun's completely underwater.

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:04.910
You don't have to worry about it...

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.140
Instructor...

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:10.020
N-Next, you will practice kicking as a pair.

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:13.270
As a pair? You mean...

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.730
Wh-Which one of us should go first?

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:16.960
Uh...

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.030
I'll start, then.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.950
O-Okay, Shiragami.

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.620
K-Kuromine-kun...

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:30.380
L-Let's both do our best.

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:32.880
Y-Yeah!

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:37.380
<i>I think this is my first time</i>

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:40.480
<i>holding a girl's hands like this,</i>

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:43.990
<i>or having one tell me to "do our best."</i>

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:48.160
What the heck? Things are 
looking good between them.

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:48.940
Boring.

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:51.120
Warms the heart, doesn't it?

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:54.690
<i>Looking good between them, huh...</i>

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:58.740
Hey, it's Mikan-chan.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:01.240
What are you guys doing here?

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:03.580
What about you? What brings you here?

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:08.650
Huh? I just... you know... 
came to get some good shots.

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:09.880
Nee-chan! Nee-chan!

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.420
Come on! Let's go to the wave pool!

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:15.640
Really? Without your camera, huh?

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.770
Are those two your brothers?

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.430
You're so good at caring for others.

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:22.410
Here, runts. Go over there and eat these.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:25.700
What? Is one of those guys your boyfriend?

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:27.080
Boyfriend, boyfriend!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.600
You know I don't have one!

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:30.770
That's right. Though there is a candidate—

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.570
You keep your trap shut!

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:36.150
You're gonna break me!

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:37.950
What's she doing?

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.210
Nee-chan talks to herself sometimes.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:41.280
Yeah.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:41.890
Let's go.

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:42.670
'Kay!

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:44.930
I swear...

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:49.640
Isn't that Asahi and Shiragami-san?

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:50.600
Yeah.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.380
Sure is.

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:54.580
What are they doing? 
Is he teaching her to swim?

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:57.060
Well, yeah, I guess you'd say that.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:04.260
Shiragami-san's really a 
rarity, as far as Asahi goes.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:05.600
How so?

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:11.270
You've known him since middle 
school, so you probably know.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:16.980
Asahi falls for girls who have 
something he doesn't, right?

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.870
Oh, yeah, you might be right.

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:23.280
He falls for girls who can take the lead,

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.410
then gets rejected.

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.480
And look at him now.

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:32.290
For the first time, it might 
not just be admiration.

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:34.540
He might really be in love.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:35.290
That was good, Shiragami.

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:40.890
And that was the self-proclaimed Heathen 
Queen, Akemi Mikan, talking about love.

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:45.010
Want me to dump you in the wave pool naked?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:46.970
It is 6:00.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:51.370
We will be closing in 30 minutes.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:55.190
I guess learning to swim in 
one day just isn't possible.

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:57.430
Well, shall we go home?

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:58.400
Yeah.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.490
Gosh, this is awful!

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:03.920
Look how tanned I got 
because of you, Aizawa-san.

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:04.780
Don't blame me.

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:07.740
It's your fault for not learning your lesson,
no matter how many times you're told.

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:11.540
<i>I just couldn't resist.</i>

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:16.180
What did you even come here 
to teach them, anyway?

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:16.180
Kuromine-kun.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:20.910
I would've rather tanned naked!

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:23.050
That's public indecency!

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:24.960
What is it, you two?

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.090
Nothing.

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.470
Coming, Aizawa-san.

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:36.420
<i>Shiragami...san...</i>

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:41.030
<b>I know how you feel,                                                            I-I'm sorry! I won't do it again...
but you can't do that.</b>

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:44.840
S-Sorry, guys!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:48.160
Uh, something just came up.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:50.660
Would you mind going on ahead?

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:55.120
Oh, i-it's nothing serious or anything...

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:57.830
You're acting suspicious.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.840
I am not!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.040
So, um... Later!

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:04.110
Very suspicious.

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:05.630
Suspicious, indeed.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:06.890
Well...

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:10.260
S-Sorry! Something just came up...

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:12.270
L-Later!

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.950
We have a pretty good idea 
of what came up, though.

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:19.770
Go for it, Leaky Basket Asahi.

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:32.200
Would you come to the school alone 
tonight, and not tell the others?

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.410
Why did she ask me to 
come to the school alone?

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:39.210
Oh, Kuromine-kun!

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:42.630
You came! Thanks so much!

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:45.320
I-It was no problem.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.480
What's up, though?

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:51.200
Um... I wanted you to go out with me...

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.350
Huh?! G-Go out?!

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:54.740
Yeah...

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:56.600
Out for secret training.

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.100
This way.

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:05.240
Okay.

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:09.440
Let's see... From what Mom said, 
it should be around here...

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:10.740
There it is!

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:13.040
Kuromine-kun, here!

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.680
Wow, you're right.

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:19.980
Still, though, secret training?

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:22.510
I didn't know you wanted to 
learn to swim that badly.

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:27.880
Yeah. I thought, if I could learn to swim,

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:34.390
I'd be able to properly thank you 
and Aizawa-san, and everyone else.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:35.680
I see.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:39.750
<i>I love that about Shiragami.</i>

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:43.490
Why are you taking your clothes off now?!

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:46.190
Huh? Well, I can't swim if I don't.

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.000
Oh! I-I have my swimsuit on underneath!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:52.120
I'm not a pervert like Shiho! Jeez!

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:54.660
<i>Y-Yeah, of course.</i>

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:58.320
<i>She wouldn't start stripping 
in front of me if she didn't...</i>

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.760
K-Kuromine-kun...

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:02.670
Huh?

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.880
Sorry, but would you look the other way?

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.840
Actually, go and change!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:11.260
Y-Yeah, you're right! Sorry!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:16.330
So, Kuromine-kun, how do 
you breathe while swimming?

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:19.270
Uh, I think... like this?

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.190
So... Like this?

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.270
Shiragami! Your fangs are showing!

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:28.570
Wait, there's no one around but us.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.530
Oh, yeah.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:35.080
Okay! I'll show you the results 
of my training earlier today!

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:43.400
How was that, Kuromine-kun?

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.730
I can already swim this far!

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:49.340
Wait, no way! Why did I only get this far?!

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.760
I bet I could go 25 meters if I did this.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.640
That isn't swimming!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.020
Yeah, that's it.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.860
And take a breath...

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:07.570
You must be tired. Ready for a break?

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.360
Yeah.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.440
By the way, Shiragami...

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:18.370
You said your mom told you about 
that hole we used to get in here?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:23.120
Yeah. Apparently my parents 
couldn't swim either,

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.830
so they'd sneak in like this and practice.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:28.650
Just like we are now?

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:29.420
Yeah.

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:32.300
I asked my mom, and...

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.300
<b>Shiragami</b>

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.300
She found out that my dad was a vampire,

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:42.420
and she kept his secret for him.

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:44.000
<b>Our class did
a haunted house! 
I was a ghost and 
Genjirou-san was a vampire!</b>

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:45.940
<b>School Fair!</b>

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:45.940
A lot of things were tough for them,

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.940
<b>In front of the frankfurter stall. 
They're really good when we
all eat them together!</b>

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:49.250
but she said they had a fun life at school.

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:55.740
So I guess,

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.570
since they were also keeping his secret,

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:01.750
they wanted to practice 
where no one would see them.

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:07.900
Now that I think about it, being at the pool 
during the day might've been dangerous.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:08.880
Like, your fangs...

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:15.750
But right now, I think it's right

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.720
not to worry about people seeing us.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:21.510
It's... "right"?

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:29.010
Before I met you, I was always alone.

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:32.570
Since I'd have to quit school 
if my secret got out,

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:35.360
I thought I had to do that, to protect it.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:40.160
But I was lonely.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:41.870
I wondered why.

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:48.790
Mom always said life at this 
school was so much fun.

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:53.300
It wasn't quite like I'd heard it would be.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:56.670
But then I met you,

00:17:57.210 --> 00:18:00.470
and Aizawa-san and Akemi-san, too...

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:02.930
And even Shiho transferred here.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.730
I got to meet your friends, too.

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:09.320
It's important to keep my secret,

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:12.980
but I realized that there are 
even more important things.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:21.380
There's no point if I'm just protecting 
my secret so I won't have to quit school.

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.520
I got to enjoy it with everyone,

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:28.120
and try hard to do things I wasn't 
good at... l-like swimming.

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:30.580
So, well...

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:33.620
I, Shiragami Youko,

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:37.510
love school now.

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:41.090
Thank you so much, Asahi-kun!

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:46.770
Huh?! D-Did you just...

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:48.950
call me by my first name?

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:51.000
Hey! Hang on!

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:54.070
Don't... Don't do that, Shiragami!

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:58.650
K-Kuromine-kun! I meant Kuromine-kun!

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.410
That was just a slip of the tongue!

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:02.640
What?! N-No way!

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:04.160
B-Break's over!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.570
Come on, back to practice!

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:08.140
Okay...

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:13.410
Want to try for 15 meters this time...

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:17.920
Y-Youko...san?

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:27.700
K-Kuromine-kun! Let's get back 
to practice, Kuromine-kun!

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:31.170
Y-Yeah, Shiragami! You're right, Shiragami!

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:37.650
Looks like two little 
mice have snuck in here.

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:42.060
Actually, to be precise, 
I guess one is a bat.

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:44.570
Do you mean Shiragami and Kuromine?

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:47.290
Yeah. They're in the pool.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.420
Peeping on them again?

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:55.130
I don't know if you're a clairvoyant 
or what, but that's bad taste.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:58.130
I just couldn't help remembering.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.130
Remembering?

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:05.550
When I was still a homeroom teacher at 
this school, there were two students,

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:08.980
a human and vampire just like them,

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:12.060
who would also sneak into 
the pool to practice swimming.

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:15.810
Do you mean Shiragami's...

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:19.030
Shiragami! This is 15 meters!

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.160
Now, Shiragami Youko...

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:30.910
What sort of story will you show me?

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:36.600
<i>What sort of human-and-vampire 
love story will yours be?</i>

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:41.420
Shiragami, you're doing great!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.930
A little more! Just a little more!

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:46.830
<i>I... I can't...</i>

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:49.680
<i>I'm at my limit...</i>

00:21:03.310 --> 00:21:04.360
I did it?

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:06.810
Yeah!

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:13.370
I did it!

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:14.660
Whoa! Shiragami!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:18.380
This is dangerous in all 
kinds of ways, Shiragami!

00:21:39.930 --> 00:21:43.330
All right! Now to go for 25 meters!

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:45.750
Yeah! You can do it, Shiragami!

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:47.240
You think so?

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:48.120
Sure!

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:27.760
<b>Actually I Am Memory Test!</b>

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:25.760
This is for all of you who've been watching 
the online commentary more than the series!

00:23:25.760 --> 00:23:27.760
The <i>Actually I Am</i> Memory Test!

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:30.660
Which of these swimsuits did Aizawa-san wear?

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:32.180
<b>Which swimsuit was Aizawa-san wearing at the pool?</b>

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:32.180
Wait, why is that me?

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:34.940
Number one: this plain workout bikini.

00:23:34.940 --> 00:23:35.850
Stop this!

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:38.280
Number two: this sexy cat bikini.

00:23:38.280 --> 00:23:40.020
That's embarrassing on many levels!

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:42.700
Number three: this traditional 
ocean swimming style!

00:23:42.700 --> 00:23:43.440
Jejeje!

00:23:43.440 --> 00:23:45.470
I'd recommend number two.

00:23:45.470 --> 00:23:47.020
R-Really?

00:23:47.020 --> 00:23:49.660
Wait, who would wear that thing?!

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:51.030
<b>Next Episode:
"Let's Be Honest!"</b>
